nd a Corroded Plate plate bracer and I will complete the ritual to enchant them.'\nGive Dorinan 3x Crushed Opal and a Corroded Plate Bracer\nLoremaster Dorinan smiles warmly as she hands you your reward.\nLoremaster Dorinan says 'You have done well.'\nYou receive: Bracers of Forbidden Rites\nBoots\nYou say, 'boots'\nLoremaster Dorinan says, 'Simply bring me a set of three crushed flame emeralds and a pair of Corroded Plate plate boots and I will imbue them. I bid you good luck in finding such things.'\nGive Dorinan 3x Crushed Flame Emerald and a Corroded Plate Boots\nLoremaster Dorinan smiles warmly as she hands you your reward.\nLoremaster Dorinan says 'You have done well.'\nYou receive: Boots of Forbidden Rites\nArms\nYou say, 'armplates'\nLoremaster Dorinan says, 'Three jaundice gems and a set of Corroded Plate plate vambraces might be an interesting combination. The powers of the gems may be harvested to imbue the vambraces.'\nGive Dorinan 3x Jaundice Gem and a Corroded Plate Vambraces\nLoremaster Dorinan smiles warmly as she hands you your reward.\nLoremaster Dorinan says 'You have done well.'\nYou receive: Vambraces of Forbidden Rites\nGloves\nYou say, 'gauntlets'\nLoremaster Dorinan says, 'Strong protection for one's hands is important. I may be able to craft you a set of powerful plate gauntlets if you find a set of Corroded Plate plate gauntlets and three crushed lava rubies.'\nGive Dorinan 3x Crushed Lava Ruby and a Corroded Plate Gauntlets\nLoremaster Dorinan smiles warmly as she hands you your reward.\nLoremaster Dorinan says 'You have done well.'\nYou receive: Gauntlets of Forbidden Rites\nHelm\nYou say, 'helm'\nLoremaster Dorinan says, 'Those who are wise as we are know that protection of the head is most important. I may be able to forge you something most interesting if you were to bring me a Corroded Plate plate helm and three pieces of crushed onyx sapphire.'\nGive Dorinan 3x Crushed Onyx Sapphire and an Corroded Plate Plate Helm\nLoremaster Dorinan smiles warmly as she hands you your reward.\nLoremaster Dorinan says 'You have done well.'\nYou receive: Crown of Forbidden Rites\nLegs\nYou say, 'greaves'\nLoremaster Dorinan says, 'A set of Corroded Plate greaves might be salvageable if you were to find three chipped onyx sapphires. With the right techniques almost anything is possible.'\nGive Dorinan 3x Chipped Onyx Sapphire and a Corroded Plate Greaves\nLoremaster Dorinan smiles warmly as she hands you your reward.\nLoremaster Dorinan says 'You have done well.'\nYou receive: Greaves of Forbidden Rites\nChest\nYou say, 'breastplate'\nLoremaster Dorinan says, 'If you find a Corroded Plate breastplate and three pieces of black marble bring them to me and I shall attempt to create an enchanted breastplate that will serve you well.'\nGive Dorinan 3x Black Marble and a Corroded Breastplate\nLoremaster Dorinan smiles warmly as she hands you your reward.\nLoremaster Dorinan says 'You have done well.'\nYou receive: Breastplate of Forbidden Rites\nSubmitted by: BobbybickRewards:\n- Boots of Forbidden Rites [item=4511]\n- Bracers of Forbidden Rites [item=4336]\n- Breastplate of Forbidden Rites [item=4954]\n- Crown of Forbidden Rites [item=4474]\n- Gauntlets of Forbidden Rites [item=4475]\n- Greaves of Forbidden Rites [item=4423]\n- Vambraces of Forbidden Rites [item=4653]\n[",
