      walkthrough = "**Level:** 45\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n\nLorekeeper Einar in the barracks near beginning of the zone offers a series of quests for monks to obtain a set of Grand Master's Armor. He can be found around location -650, 45.\nYou must be at least KINDLY with Coldain in order to complete these quests.\nYou say, 'Hail, Lorekeeper Einar'\nLorekeeper Einar says, 'Greetings to you. I seek one that has chosen the path of monkhood. What do you call yourself?'\nYou say, 'I am a monk'\nLorekeeper Einar says, 'Good. I had hoped you were one. I have heard that as seeker of the way you are in constant training to push yourself to your physical and mental limits. It is an admirable quality and I wish to aid you. I will provide you with a cap, a tunic, sleeves, bracers, gloves, leggings and boots.'\nEroded Armor molds drop from giants in the Kael Arena. Gems can be found on a variety of different creatures throughout velious with some, such as diamonds, coming from higher level creatures.\nQUICK LIST\nBracer - 3x Crushed Flame Emerald + Eroded Leather Bracelet\nBoots - 3x Crushed Black Marble + Eroded Leather Boots\nArms - 3x Flawed Emerald + Eroded Leather Sleeves\nGloves - 3x Crushed Topaz + Eroded Leather Gloves\nHelm - 3x Crushed Coral + Eroded Leather Cap\nLegs - 3x Flawed Sea Sapphire + Eroded Leather Leggings\nChest - 3x Flawless Diamond + Eroded Leather Tunic\nBracer\nYou say, 'bracers'\nLorekeeper Einar says, 'For the bracers, I will require a eroded leather bracelet as well as three crushed flame emeralds. Return to me when you find such things.'\nGive Lorekeeper Einar 3x Crushed Flame Emerald and a Eroded Leather Wristband\nLorekeeper Einar smiles warmly as he hands you your reward.\nLorekeeper Einar says 'You have done well.'\nYou receive: Grand Master's Wrist Wraps\nBoots\nYou say, 'boots'\nLorekeeper Einar says, 'We use our feet so often, should not they be protected as well as any other portion of our bodies? If you seek fine protection for your feet return to me with three pieces of crushed black marble and a pair of eroded leather boots.'\nGive Lorekeeper Einar 3x Crushed Black Marble and a Eroded Leather Boots\nLorekeeper Einar smiles warmly as he hands you your reward.\nLorekeeper Einar says 'You have done well.'\nYou receive: Grand Master's Slippers\nArms\nYou say, 'sleeves'\nLorekeeper Einar says, 'Protection for your arms will come at the price of three flawed emeralds and a set of eroded leather sleeves.'\nGive Lorekeeper Einar 3x Flawed Emerald and a Eroded Leather Sleeves\nLorekeeper Einar smiles warmly as he hands you your reward.\nLorekeeper Einar says 'You have done well.'\nYou receive: Grand Master's Arm Wraps\nGloves\nYou say, 'gloves'\nLorekeeper Einar says, 'Protecting your hands is very important. I can create some excellent protection for your hands if you bring me three crushed topaz and a pair of eroded leather gloves.'\nGive Lorekeeper Einar 3x Crushed Topaz and a Eroded Leather Gloves\nLorekeeper Einar smiles warmly as he hands you your reward.\nLorekeeper Einar says 'You have done well.'\nYou receive: Fist of the Grand Master\nHelm\nYou say, 'cap'\nLorekeeper Einar says, 'To create a piece of armor to protect your sensitive skull I will require three pieces of crushed coral as well as a eroded leather cap.'\nGive Lorekeeper Einar 3x Crushed Coral and an Eroded Leather Cap\nLorekeeper Einar smiles warmly as he hands you your reward.\nLorekeeper Einar says 'You have done well.'\nYou receive: Grand Master's Headband\nLegs\nYou say, 'leggings'\nLorekeeper Einar says, 'I may be able to craft a set of wondrous leggings from a set of old eroded leather leggings and three flawed sea sapphires. It is amazing what you can do with a bit of magic.'\nGive Lorekeeper Einar 3x Flawed Sea Sapphire and a Eroded Leather Leggings\nLorekeeper Einar smiles warmly as he hands you your reward.\nLorekeeper Einar says 'You have done well.'\nYou receive: Grand Master's Leg Wraps\nChest\nYou say, 'tunic'\nLorekeeper Einar says, 'To create a spectacular tunic fit for your kind I will require three flawless diamonds and an eroded leather tunic. With the gems and my skills I may be able to draw out some of its magical powers.'\nGive Lorekeeper Einar 3x Flawless Diamond and a Corroded Leather Tunic\nLorekeeper Einar smiles warmly as he hands you your reward.\nLorekeeper Einar says 'You have done well.'\nYou receive: Grand Master's Chest Wraps\nSubmitted by: BobbybickRewards:\n- Fist of the Grand Master [item=5331]\n- Grand Master's Arm Wraps [item=4898]\n- Grand Master's Chest Wraps [item=5028]\n- Grand Master's Headband [item=4512]\n- Grand Master's Leg Wraps [item=4513]\n- Grand Master's Slippers [item=4698]\n- Grand Master's Wrist Wraps [item=4514]\n[",
