      walkthrough = "**Level:** 45\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n\nForeman Felspar found near the mines in Thurgadin offers a series of quests for rogues to obtain a set of Brigand's Armor. He can be found around location 46, -140.\nYou must be at least KINDLY with Coldain in order to complete these quests.\nYou say, 'Hail, Foreman Felspar'\nForeman Felspar says, 'Welcome to the Thurgadin Minin' Company, (playerrace). As foreman it's my job to see that me lads are well trained and well cared fer. Unfortunately, we're not in too good shape right now. Ye see, it seems a new vein was struck recently and a bunch of unwelcome critters have come crawlin outta the works attackin' me lads. In order ta help combat this menace I've engineered a new set of armor for the miners, but need some raw materials to get them started.'\nYou say, 'New set of armor'\nForeman Felspar says, 'Excellent, (playername)! I knew ye were the right (playerrace) for the job. The pieces I can make are a coif, a tunic, sleeves, bracers, gauntlets, leggings, and boots. This stuff might not be fitting ya if ye're not stealthy like us miners though.'\nCorroded Armor molds drop from giants in the Kael Arena. Gems can be found on a variety of different creatures throughout velious with some, such as diamonds, coming from higher level creatures.\nQUICK LIST\nBracer - 3x Crushed Flame Emerald + Corroded Chain Bracer\nBoots - 3x Crushed Black Marble + Corroded Chain Boots\nArms - 3x Flawed Emerald + Corroded Chain Sleeves\nGloves - 3x Crushed Topaz + Corroded Chain Gauntlets\nHelm - 3x Crushed Coral + Corroded Chain Coif\nLegs - 3x Flawed Sea Sapphire + Corroded Chain Leggings\nChest - 3x Flawless Diamond + Corroded Chain Tunic\nBracer\nYou say, 'bracers'\nForeman Felspar says, 'For the bracers, I will require a corroded chain bracer as well as three crushed flame emeralds.  Return to me when you find such things, (playername).'\nGive Felspar 3x Crushed Flame Emerald and a Corroded Chain Bracer\nForeman Felspar smiles warmly as he hands you your reward.\nForeman Felspar says 'You have done well.'\nYou receive: Brigand's Bracer\nBoots\nYou say, 'boots'\nForeman Felspar says, 'We use our feet so often, should not they be protected as well as any other portion of our bodies?  If you seek fine protection for your feet, return to me with three pieces of crushed black marble and a set of corroded chain boots.'\nGive Felspar 3x Crushed Black Marble and a Corroded Chain Boots\nForeman Felspar smiles warmly as he hands you your reward.\nForeman Felspar says 'You have done well.'\nYou receive: Brigand's Boots\nArms\nYou say, 'sleeves'\nForeman Felspar says, 'Protection for your arms will come at the price of three flawed emeralds and a set of corroded chain sleeves.'\nGive Felspar 3x Flawed Emerald and a Corroded Chain Sleeves\nForeman Felspar smiles warmly as he hands you your reward.\nForeman Felspar says 'You have done well.'\nYou receive: Brigand's Vambraces\nGloves\nYou say, 'gauntlets'\nForeman Felspar says, 'Protecting your hands is very important.  I can forge protection for your hands if you bring me a pair of corroded chain gauntlets and three crushed topaz.'\nGive Felspar 3x Crushed Topaz and a Corroded Chain Gauntlets\nForeman Felspar smiles warmly as he hands you your reward.\nForeman Felspar says 'You have done well.'\nYou receive: Brigand's Gauntlets\nHelm\nYou say, 'coif'\nForeman Felspar says, 'To create a piece of armor to protect your sensitive skull. I will require three pieces of crushed coral as well as a corroded chain coif.'\nGive Felspar 3x Crushed Coral and an Corroded Chain Coif\nForeman Felspar smiles warmly as he hands you your reward.\nForeman Felspar says 'You have done well.'\nYou receive: Brigand's Circlet\nLegs\nYou say, 'leggings'\nForeman Felspar says, 'A set of corroded chain leggings might be salvageable if you were to find three flawed sea sapphires.  With the right techniques and ingredients almost anything is possible.'\nGive Felspar 3x Flawed Sea Sapphire and a Corroded Chain Leggings\nForeman Felspar smiles warmly as he hands you your reward.\nForeman Felspar says 'You have done well.'\nYou receive: Brigand's Greaves\nChest\nYou say, 'tunic'\nForeman Felspar says, 'To forge a spectacular chain tunic I will require three flawless diamonds and a corroded chain tunic.  With the gems and my skills I may be able to draw out some of its magical powers.'\nGive Felspar 3x Flawless Diamond and a Corroded Chain Tunic\nForeman Felspar smiles warmly as he hands you your reward.\nForeman Felspar says 'You have done well.'\nYou receive: Brigand's Chestguard\nSubmitted by: BobbybickRewards:\n- Brigand's Boots [item=4561]\n- Brigand's Bracer [item=5479]\n- Brigand's Chestguard [item=4981]\n- Brigand's Circlet [item=4980]\n- Brigand's Gauntlets [item=4979]\n- Brigand's Greaves [item=5637]\n- Brigand's Vambraces [item=4996]\n[",
