      walkthrough = "**Level:** 45\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n\nLorekeeper Brita found inside the library of Thurgadin offers a series of quests for enchanters to obtain a set of Beguiler's Armor. She can be found around location -170, 800.\nYou must be at least KINDLY with Coldain in order to complete these quests.\nYou say, 'Hail, Lorekeeper Brita'\nLorekeeper Brita says, 'Greetings to you.  I seek those who call themselves enchanters.  Are you an enchanter?'\nYou say, 'I am an enchanter'\nLorekeeper Brita says, 'I thought so.  I have several tasks for you accomplish.  Once you have completed them I will have a cap, a robe, sleeves, wristbands, gloves, leggings and boots to reward you with.'\nTorn Enchanted Silk armor molds drop from giants in the Kael Arena. Gems can be found on a variety of different creatures throughout velious with some, such as diamonds, coming from higher level creatures.\nQUICK LIST\nBracer - 3x Crushed Onyx Sapphire + Torn Enchanted Silk Wristband\nBoots  - 3x Crushed Jaundice Gem + Torn Enchanted Silk Boots\nArms - 3x Flawed Topaz + Torn Enchanted Silk Sleeves\nGloves - 3x Crushed Topaz + Torn Enchanted Silk Gloves\nHelm - 3x Crushed Flame Opal + Torn Enchanted Silk Turban\nLegs - 3x Nephrite + Torn Enchanted Silk Pantaloons\nChest - 3x Pristine Emerald + Torn Enchanted Silk Robe\nBracer\nYou say, 'wristbands'\nLorekeeper Brita says 'An enchanted silk wristguard and three crushed onyx sapphires is all that I require to create an imbued wrist wrap of great power.  Seek out these items and return to me when you have acquired them.'\nGive Brita 3x Crushed Onyx Sapphire and a Torn Enchanted Silk Wristband\nLorekeeper Brita smiles warmly as she hands you your reward.\nLorekeeper Brita says 'You have done well.'\nYou receive: Beguiler's Wristguard\nBoots\nYou say, 'boots'\nLorekeeper Brita says 'Three crushed jaundice gems combined with torn enchanted silk boots would make a most interesting set of footwear.  The latent powers of the gems can be harnessed to create magical effects.'\nGive Brita 3x Crushed Jaundice Gem and a Torn Enchanted Silk Boots\nLorekeeper Brita smiles warmly as she hands you your reward.\nLorekeeper Brita says 'You have done well.'\nYou receive: Beguiler's Slippers\nArms\nYou say, 'sleeves'\nLorekeeper Brita says 'Bring unto me a set of torn enchanted silk sleeves as well as three flawed topaz.  With these in my possession I can create a set of enchanted sleeves the likes of which spellcasters like you dream of.'\nGive Brita 3x Flawed Topaz and a Torn Enchanted Silk Sleeves\nLorekeeper Brita smiles warmly as she hands you your reward.\nLorekeeper Brita says 'You have done well.'\nYou receive:  Beguiler's Sleeves\nGloves\nYou say, 'gloves'\nLorekeeper Brita says 'If you seek gloves of great power, bring to me three crushed topaz and a pair of torn enchanted silk gloves.  I will use the power of the gems to imbue the gloves.'\nGive Brita 3x Crushed Topaz and a Torn Enchanted Silk Gloves\nLorekeeper Brita smiles warmly as she hands you your reward.\nLorekeeper Brita says 'You have done well.'\nYou receive:  Beguiler's Gloves\nHelm\nYou say, 'cap'\nLorekeeper Brita says 'For an enchanted head guard bring me a torn enchanted silk turban as well as three pieces of crushed flame opal.'\nGive Brita 3x Crushed Flame Opal and an Torn Enchanted Silk Turban\nLorekeeper Brita smiles warmly as she hands you your reward.\nLorekeeper Brita says 'You have done well.'\nYou receive: Beguiler's Crown\nLegs\nYou say, 'leggings'\nLorekeeper Brita says 'Three nephrite and a pair of torn enchanted silk leggings will net you a fine set of pantaloons.'\nGive Brita 3x Nephrite and a Torn Enchanted Silk Pantaloons\nLorekeeper Brita smiles warmly as she hands you your reward.\nLorekeeper Brita says 'You have done well.'\nYou receive: Beguiler's Trousers\nChest\nYou say, 'robe'\nLorekeeper Brita says 'With three pristine emeralds and a torn enchanted silk robe I will fashion a wonderous robe for you.'\nGive Brita 3x Pristine Emerald and a Torn Enchanted Silk Robe\nLorekeeper Brita smiles warmly as she hands you your reward.\nLorekeeper Brita says 'You have done well.'\nYou receive: Beguiler's Robe\nSubmitted by: BobbybickRewards:\n- Beguiler's Crown [item=4545]\n- Beguiler's Gloves [item=4541]\n- Beguiler's Robe [item=4892]\n- Beguiler's Sleeves [item=4147]\n- Beguiler's Slippers [item=3952]\n- Beguiler's Trousers [item=4872]\n- Beguiler's Wristguard [item=4771]\n[",
