      walkthrough = "**Level:** 45\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n\nGlatigi found near the mines in Thurgadin offers a series of quests for berserkers to obtain a set of Icefury Armor. He can be found around location 5, -545.\nYou must be at least KINDLY with Coldain in order to complete these quests.\nYou say, 'Hail, Glatigi'\nGlatigi says, 'Well met, (playerrace)! I am Glatigi. If ye seek ta join our ranks, I welcome ye with open arms and have an offer to make if you are interested. If ye seek to be our enemy, I hope ye can run swifter than my archers arrows.'\nYou say, 'I am interested'\nGlatigi says, 'Aye, I thought ye might be. My elite Berserkers are in sore need of some enchanted armor. Unfortunately, I canâ€™t spare the men to go out and fetch me the components. If you can do this for me, Iâ€™ll gladly reward you with a piece of it. I need materials for a coif, a tunic, sleeves, bracers, gauntlets, leggings, and boots.'\nCorroded Armor molds drop from giants in the Kael Arena. Gems can be found on a variety of different creatures throughout velious with some, such as diamonds, coming from higher level creatures.\nQUICK LIST\nBracer - 3x Crushed Flame Emerald + Corroded Chain Bracer\nBoots - 3x Crushed Black Marble + Corroded Chain Boots\nArms - 3x Flawed Emerald + Corroded Chain Sleeves\nGloves - 3x Crushed Topaz + Corroded Chain Gauntlets\nHelm - 3x Crushed Coral + Corroded Chain Coif\nLegs - 3x Flawed Sea Sapphire + Corroded Chain Leggings\nChest - 3x Flawless Diamond + Corroded Chain Tunic\nBracer\nYou say, 'bracers'\nGlatigi says, 'For the bracers, I will require a corroded chain bracer as well as three crushed flame emeralds.  Return to me when you find such things, (playername).'\nGive Glatigi 3x Crushed Flame Emerald and a Corroded Chain Bracer\nGlatigi smiles warmly as he hands you your reward.\nGlatigi says 'You have done well.'\nYou receive: Icefury Bracer\nBoots\nYou say, 'boots'\nGlatigi says, 'We use our feet so often, should not they be protected as well as any other portion of our bodies?  If you seek fine protection for your feet, return to me with three pieces of crushed black marble and a set of corroded chain boots.'\nGive Glatigi 3x Crushed Black Marble and a Corroded Chain Boots\nGlatigi smiles warmly as he hands you your reward.\nGlatigi says 'You have done well.'\nYou receive: Icefury Boots\nArms\nYou say, 'sleeves'\nGlatigi says, 'Protection for your arms will come at the price of three flawed emeralds and a set of corroded chain sleeves.'\nGive Glatigi 3x Flawed Emerald and a Corroded Chain Sleeves\nGlatigi smiles warmly as he hands you your reward.\nGlatigi says 'You have done well.'\nYou receive: Icefury Sleeves\nGloves\nYou say, 'gauntlets'\nGlatigi says, 'Protecting your hands is very important.  I can forge protection for your hands if you bring me a pair of corroded chain gauntlets and three crushed topaz.'\nGive Glatigi 3x Crushed Topaz and a Corroded Chain Gauntlets\nGlatigi smiles warmly as he hands you your reward.\nGlatigi says 'You have done well.'\nYou receive: Icefury Gauntlets\nHelm\nYou say, 'coif'\nGlatigi says, 'To create a piece of armor to protect your sensitive skull. I will require three pieces of crushed coral as well as a corroded chain coif.'\nGive Glatigi 3x Crushed Coral and an Corroded Chain Coif\nGlatigi smiles warmly as he hands you your reward.\nGlatigi says 'You have done well.'\nYou receive: Icefury Coif\nLegs\nYou say, 'leggings'\nGlatigi says, 'A set of corroded chain leggings might be salvageable if you were to find three flawed sea sapphires.  With the right techniques and ingredients almost anything is possible.'\nGive Glatigi 3x Flawed Sea Sapphire and a Corroded Chain Leggings\nGlatigi smiles warmly as he hands you your reward.\nGlatigi says 'You have done well.'\nYou receive: Icefury Greaves\nChest\nYou say, 'tunic'\nGlatigi says, 'For the breastplate, I will need a corroded chain tunic and three flawless diamonds. Once I have them in my possession it will not take long to craft a sturdy tunic.'\nGive Glatigi 3x Flawless Diamond and a Corroded Chain Tunic\nGlatigi smiles warmly as he hands you your reward.\nGlatigi says 'You have done well.'\nYou receive: Icefury Tunic\nSubmitted by: BobbybickRewards:\n- Icefury Boots [item=26701]\n- Icefury Bracer [item=26516]\n- Icefury Coif [item=29787]\n- Icefury Gauntlets [item=26703]\n- Icefury Greaves [item=26702]\n- Icefury Sleeves [item=26518]\n- Icefury Tunic [item=26517]\n[",
